        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2156, 7-1/4 x 2 Inch Rectangular Dummy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Narrow Rectangular Dummy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware comes packaged with 2 flush pulls and a dummy mortise that has a cutout to accept a latch from a keyed or privacy pocket door mortise. This makes it able to be used on the inactive side of a pair of sliding doors. The Narrow Rectangular Dummy Pocket Door Set is available in a wide array of finishes so you'll be able to match your personal style. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick. The trim plates are 1/8 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Dummy Function:</b> This set neither locks nor latches. It features two flush pulls and a mortise box with a built in finger edge pull to help retrieve the door from the pocket.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/narrow-rectangular-passage-pocket-door-set-emtek-2154\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/narrow-rectangular-privacy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2155\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/narrow-rectangular-pocket-door-keyed-entry-emtek-2153\"><b>Keyed Entry Function</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Dummy Narrow Rectangular Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Finger Grab Dimensions: 7/8\"w x 2\"h</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2156-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262402\"><b>Emtek 2156 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a dummy set mortise pull, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
